WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.056
Here is the workflow we will follow First identify
how the dataset

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:11.770
is organized Second assess whether the values are
trustworthy enough for the intended

00:00:11.796 --> 00:00:17.840
use Third classify variables by meaning Fourth

00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:23.696
use that meaning to choose summaries charts and
preprocessing Finally implement

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:29.669
those choices in Python or PostgreSQL This order is
important

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:34.908
Technical transformations should follow conceptual
decisions not replace them
